  "boundary": "These are views of existing source records, not new witnesses or adjudications. Counts retain their declared native units and must not be summed as unique objects. Registers may contain project hypotheses or untraced alternatives. Only explicitly attributed, aligned readings can support an editorial comparison; no alternative-pair or independent-witness count is inferred by this tool."
